    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11365" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαμφιέννυμι</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strip off garments,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέρν᾽ ἀπημφιεσμέναι</span>
			<i>having</i> them <i>stripped bare,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Xenarch.
				4.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>strip off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοίχους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.516f
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.117
			</span></i>.</div>
